  "problem": "A video game randomly selects a level difficulty $d$ from $1$ to $500,$ with each value equally likely. Once the difficulty is chosen, a treasure chest is placed in one of $d$ zones within the level, numbered from $1$ to $d,$ with each zone equally likely to receive the chest.\n\nWhat is the expected number of the zone where the chest appears?\n\nThe expected number of the zone where the chest appears is\n{{field-1}}.",
